# Response headers for hosts that read a `_headers` file (Cloudflare Pages, Netlify).
# COOP + COEP make the page cross-origin isolated, so AppDatabaseFactory uses the
# WebWorker + OPFS SQLite driver and data survives a reload. Without them (GitHub Pages
# cannot send headers) the app falls back to an in-memory database. Same headers as
# webpack.config.d/dev-server-headers.js uses locally.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
